                "linkAssistiveText" : "",
                "paddingHorizontal" : "none",
                "paddingVertical" : "none",
                "text" : "Our tours start with an introduction at our main facility. Your tour guide will introduce you to ginseng and our company, then ask questions to tailor the tour specific to each group. During this time, you will be introduced to ginseng, learn the differences between American and Asian ginseng and understand the history of ginseng and our company.",
