                    "text" : "We have several fields of ginseng at different ages and stages of the growth cycle depending on the month or season of your visit. Experience one of our ginseng gardens in person. Learn about the unique growth cycle of American ginseng, field prep, and cultivation challenges of this specialty crop.",
